            "knowledgeType": "concept",
            "summary": "Python 的默认参数值只在函数定义时求值一次。如果默认值是可变列表，多次调用会共享同一个列表对象，导致修改在调用之间保留。使用 None 作为默认值并在函数体内创建新列表可以避免共享。",
            "example": {
              "type": "example",
              "text": "def add_item(item, lst=[]):\n    lst.append(item)\n    return lst\n\nprint(add_item(1))  # [1]\nprint(add_item(2))  # [1, 2]  # 共享列表导致保留\n\ndef add_item_safe(item, lst=None):\n    if lst is None:\n        lst = []\n    lst.append(item)\n    return lst\n\nprint(add_item_safe(1))  # [1]\nprint(add_item_safe(2))  # [2]  # 每次新列表",
              "origin": "authored"
            },
            "boundaries": "",
            "analogy": "",
            "mantra": ""
